1
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:20,920
Evacuate quickly

2
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,000
Dean Chen,

3
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,280
for this

4
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,440
training exercise,

5
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,680
we specifically selected

6
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,840
the two top battalions in the brigade.

7
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:18,440
The cadets are assigned to the Red Force,

8
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:21,400
and coordinated with the Air Force for support.

9
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,320
Our main goal is to let

10
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,120
our cadets

11
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,640
fully and deeply experience

12
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,720
how a combined arms battalion

13
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,880
executes various combat missions.

14
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,160
Thank you, Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

15
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,880
The exercise between the Red and Blue forces

16
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,480
is quite lively,

17
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:41,760
but at this crucial point in the battle,

18
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:44,360
my cadet detachment

19
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,040
looks like they're still asleep.

20
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:51,000
Did you not assign them any strike targets,

21
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,840
or are these kids just completely out of it?

22
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:55,040
Chief, don't worry.

23
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,160
Rest assured,

24
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,800
our cadet team

25
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,640
will soon

26
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,360
have their moment to shine.

27
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:03,520
Li Songwei.

28
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,640
Remember,

29
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,240
you must strictly follow the exercise plan

30
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,720
and the timeline.

31
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,080
The Air Force won't arrive until 10:00.

32
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,560
Once the airstrike is over,

33
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,040
our First Battalion

34
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,160
needs to be generous,

35
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,720
letting the Infantry Academy cadets

36
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:17,600
charge up the hill first

37
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,880
to plant the red flag on the high ground.

38
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:19,880
Understood?

39
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,000
Yes, sir.

40
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:24,520
Lao Sang,

41
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,560
what's the situation with the cadet detachment?

42
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,440
They're following orders.

43
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,120
They've been on standby at Hill 174

44
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,760
and are ready to charge the summit at any time.

45
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:32,920
Good.

46
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,120
By the way,

47
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,960
when the exercise ends,

48
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:36,680
don't forget

49
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,800
to have someone take photos of them on-site.

50
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:41,080
Especially capture the moment they plant the flag.

51
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,840
We'll make a video later

52
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,720
for the cadets to take back as a souvenir.

53
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,880
Isn't this a bit inappropriate?

54
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,120
This time,

55
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,800
we're in a joint exercise with the Infantry Academy.

56
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,320
That means these cadets

57
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,600
are soldiers of our Red Force.

58
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,200
If we keep leaving them in the back

59
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,200
to just act as extras,

60
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,200
won't they have complaints in the end?

61
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,640
What complaints?

62
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,040
The final highlight moment

63
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,400
is all saved for them, isn't it?

64
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,520
What else could they complain about?

65
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,080
Besides,

66
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,280
precisely because it's a joint training,

67
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,760
if anyone gets hurt,

68
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,400
whose responsibility is it?

69
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,080
Yours

70
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:10,840
or mine?

71
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:16,960
Deputy Captain,

72
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,360
when are we moving out?

73
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,320
If we don't fight soon,

74
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,400
the battle will be over.

75
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,680
Wait for the Captain's orders.

76
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,560
Deputy Captain, where is our Captain?

77
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,680
Don't ask what you shouldn't.

78
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,880
You'll get your chance to perform.

79
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,040
Yes, sir.

80
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:30,720
Captain,

81
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,280
the battle is almost over.

82
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,400
Why did we come here?

83
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,000
Shut up.

84
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:34,920
Follow orders.

85
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:40,760
Get ready to move out.

86
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:41,720
Captain!

87
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,040
That's an Exercise Control vehicle.

88
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,040
Cut the crap.

89
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,360
Obey orders.

90
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:50,480
Move out!

91
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,200
Comrade,

92
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:02,040
we are from Exercise Control.

93
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,160
Exercise Control is exactly who we're looking for.

94
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,280
Battalion Commander!

95
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,760
1st Co, 1st Bn took our forward position.

96
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,600
They are advancing toward the summit.

97
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,040
Why the panic?

98
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,400
If the position is lost, it's lost.

99
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:24,840
Isn't this exactly the performance

100
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,280
Liu Wangyuan is looking for?

101
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,320
We're just the extras this time.

102
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,720
The supporting cast.

103
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,800
Just stick to the script,

104
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,960
play nice,

105
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:36,600
and play along with these cadets

106
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,520
for a bit.

107
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:40,120
He's abusing his power for revenge.

108
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,600
He couldn't beat us as 1st Bn Commander.

109
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,520
Now he's Ops and Training Chief,

110
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,800
he's stepping on us for kicks

111
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,120
and to make himself look good.

112
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:52,280
First day knowing Liu Wangyuan?

113
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,040
Do me a favor.

114
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,040
Keep the men in line.

115
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,800
Yes, sir.

116
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,960
Commanders and comrades,

117
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:28,560
the exercise is paused for 15 minutes.

118
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:31,480
We will resume after the break.

119
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,880
What's going on here?

120
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,280
What else could it be?

121
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:38,960
The commanders are here, obviously.

122
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,600
Company Commander.

123
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,920
What is it now?

124
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,600
Orders from the command post.

125
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,440
A 15-minute break.

126
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,640
Later, we'll follow commands as a group

127
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,080
and shout slogans.

128
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:55,280
Seriously.

129
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,120
Going by Liu Wangyuan's logic,

130
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:59,400
there'd be a halftime in real combat too?

131
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,960
You think you know it all, huh?

132
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,560
Alright, Company Commander.

133
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,320
I just want to know,

134
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:06,640
having our recon squad charge with a flag,

135
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,680
whose stupid idea was that?

136
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:11,080
It's an insult to us scouts.

137
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,240
That's enough.

138
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,040
Stop your complaining.

139
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,080
Section Chief Liu said

140
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:18,160
you'll lead the cadets later

141
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,320
to reap

142
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,920
the fruits of victory.

143
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,440
They're sticking their necks out for us.

144
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,960
What's the point of winning like this?

145
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,200
Honestly,

146
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,040
if battles were fought like this,

147
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,280
we'd be better off going home to farm.

148
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,360
Squad Leader,

149
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,559
you shouldn't say that.

150
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,200
Farming would be a waste of your talents.

151
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,480
We have to be actors for Liu Wangyuan, right?

152
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,760
Spare me!

153
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,240
Squad Leader, go easy on me.

154
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,720
We all know your golden right foot

155
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,120
made a company commander back in the day.

156
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,560
If it kicks me into a promotion,

157
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:49,800
I'd feel pretty embarrassed.

158
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:51,320
Then I'll just give you a few more kicks.

159
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:52,960
Stand up!

160
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:58,000
Dean Chen.

161
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,280
My apologies, my apologies.

162
00:08:59,440 --> 00:08:59,880
Deputy Army Commander Liang.

163
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,560
I rushed over right after the meeting.

164
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,680
But look, I'm still late.

165
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,080
Look at you.

166
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,960
No need for such formalities between us.

167
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,400
Having you come to our front lines

168
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,760
is something I could only wish for.

169
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,400
You say no formalities, no formalities,

170
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,400
yet you still can't help yourself.

171
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,000
Have a seat.

172
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,520
Army Commander Huang knows your temper.

173
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,520
He didn't send anyone else,

174
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,840
so I'll be accompanying you the whole time.

175
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,520
Is that alright?

176
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,320
That's great.

177
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,200
We're old friends and old classmates.

178
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:24,120
This makes it easier to communicate.

179
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,280
What's the situation now?

180
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:29,560
Why the ceasefire?

181
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,080
Report!

182
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,720
Sir!

183
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,880
I was afraid you'd miss the best part,

184
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:38,400
so I paused the exercise for 15 minutes.

185
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:39,600
Suo Jian'an!

186
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:40,880
Are you kidding me?

187
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,080
Can you pause a real war?

188
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,760
You know this is a serious violation?

189
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:45,800
Yes, sir!

190
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,840
Dean Chen is an infantry command expert.

191
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:51,040
You've completely embarrassed yourself!

192
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,120
Yes, sir.

193
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,200
I'll definitely correct it next time.

194
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,160
Dean Chen,

195
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,760
please don't mind him.

196
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,800
Understood, understood.

197
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,680
As for what's next,

198
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,440
just proceed with the exercise as planned.

199
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,200
Just don't leave my cadet detachment idle.

200
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,800
Yes, sir.

201
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,160
Comrades!

202
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,240
Our battalion,

203
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,480
on the journey of revolution,

204
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,200
has been invincible.

205
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,480
We have conquered fortress after fortress

206
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,800
and defeated formidable enemy after enemy.

207
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:22,800
As we embark on this grand new journey,

208
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,720
do we have confidence?

209
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,080
Battalion Commander.

210
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,360
What is Liu Wangyuan doing?

211
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,400
The Chief is here.

212
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:32,760
Doesn't he have to show off a little?

213
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,680
Otherwise,

214
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,040
would he still be Liu Wangyuan?

215
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,680
Battalion Commander.

216
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,400
We've lost anyway.

217
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:41,920
Since the Chief is here,

218
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,360
we should at least put up a struggle,

219
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,360
so we don't go down looking so pathetic.

220
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,480
A loss is a loss either way.

221
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,880
Why bother struggling?

222
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:56,760
Report, Battalion Commander!

223
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:57,720
Someone from Exercise Control is here.

224
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:58,640
Let him in.

225
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,160
Yes, sir.

226
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,280
Battalion Commander Jiang.

227
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,520
We are from Exercise Control.

228
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,840
We've come specifically to relay

229
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,040
Deputy Army Commander Liang's new orders.

230
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,040
Please go ahead.

231
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,880
Can we really do this?

232
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,200
This is against discipline.

233
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,760
I'll take the blame for whatever happens.

234
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,360
But...

235
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,360
Red Force's strike is deemed invalid.

236
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,800
Blue Force sustained zero battle damage.

237
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,000
Report.

238
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:58,360
Go ahead.

239
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,640
Commander, it's like this.

240
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,680
To ensure the exercise proceeds smoothly,

241
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,120
it was agreed

242
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,120
to strictly follow the exercise timeline

243
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:10,000
to carry out strikes.

244
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,720
Am I to understand this correctly?

245
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,640
Because of me,

246
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,440
you paused the exercise,

247
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:15,640
but the Air Force

248
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:17,440
still moved in at the agreed time

249
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,440
to bomb?

250
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:19,560
They bombed an empty field.

251
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,360
Do you see that?

252
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,800
It's all empty space.

253
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:24,200
What a massive blunder this is.

254
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:24,960
Am I right?

255
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,600
That appears to be the case.

256
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:32,640
The Air... Air...

257
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,200
How did you coordinate with the Air Force?

258
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:37,760
Commander.

259
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,920
For this matter,

260
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,240
I also bear responsibility.

261
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,640
Commander, the blame is entirely mine.

262
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:44,800
If this is how you conduct an exercise,

263
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,560
your next step should be training on

264
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,240
how to surrender.

265
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,680
And which surrender pose looks best.

266
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:51,240
Right?

267
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,080
Aren't we still on a halftime break?

268
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,440
See that?

269
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:01,120
This is what they call real combat.

270
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,360
If this exercise ends just like this,

271
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,840
our cadets will think from now on

272
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:07,720
that these phony exercises are the norm.

273
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,360
But by doing this,

274
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,720
aren't you going a bit too far?

275
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:11,600
How about

276
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,840
you go discuss it with Section Chief Liu again?

277
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:13,680
Discuss what?

278
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:16,800
Section Chief Liu just wants to show off.

279
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,640
Do you know what he told me?

280
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:21,440
He called our academy armchair generals.

281
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:23,560
And amateurs at live-fire combat.

282
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,440
Look at this.

283
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,960
This is their live-fire combat.

284
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,280
Then what's our next step?

285
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:31,760
You lead the team and stay here.

286
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,440
The Blue Force will launch a counterattack soon.

287
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,760
I'll take a small squad

288
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,280
to execute a more important mission.

289
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:37,040
Understood.

290
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,520
Squad One, follow me.

291
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:40,920
Yes, sir.

292
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,920
Dean Chen, I apologize.

293
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:47,320
I wanted to show you a great combat drill.

294
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,040
Instead,

295
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:50,000
you watched a completely botched exercise.

296
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,360
We took it very seriously before you came.

297
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,960
We specially coordinated fighter jets.

298
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:54,800
And the result?

299
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,680
The more we cared, the worse it got.

300
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,440
The exercise isn't over yet, is it?

301
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,760
Let's keep watching.

302
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,320
I say, Kang Baoping,

303
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,920
while Brigade Commander Yang is away,

304
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:06,360
you can't be completely hands-off.

305
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:09,520
You can't slack off on military matters.

306
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:14,800
What a joke. Dean Chen, let's go.

307
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,280
Let's step outside for some fresh air.

308
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:17,000
Wait a minute.

309
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,000
Commanders.

310
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,720
The Blue Force has started its counterattack.

311
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,480
What's gotten into them?

312
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,480
Have they lost their minds?

313
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,160
They should've fought like this all along.

314
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:56,400
So satisfying!

315
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,680
Jiang Shengqiang must be crazy.

316
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,560
He's breaking the exercise rules.

317
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:14,800
Jiang Shengqiang. Jiang Shengqiang.

318
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,000
Jiang Shengqiang, come in.

319
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,480
Report, Battalion Commander.

320
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,720
Our forces have launched a counterattack.

321
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,160
We've now retaken some of the positions.

322
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,040
Good.

323
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:32,760
Listen up, everyone.

324
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:35,600
Deputy Army Commander Liang gave an order.

325
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:38,360
We must show our true strength and fight.

326
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,400
So,

327
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:41,360
we must go all out.

328
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,080
Completely annihilate the Red Army.

329
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,800
Let them witness

330
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,840
the true strength of our Second Battalion.

331
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,960
And let these cadets see

332
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:51,520
what a real battlefield is like.

333
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:52,520
Yes, sir!

334
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:24,320
Suo Jian'an.

335
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,240
Here!

336
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,240
Was this stunt of yours

337
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,280
premeditated,

338
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,480
or improvised on the spot?

339
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,000
You fought well.

340
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,040
Company Commander!

341
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,120
Li Songwei!

342
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,880
Organize your men and hold the line!

343
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,119
We can't!

344
00:17:05,359 --> 00:17:06,680
The Blue Force ambushed us!

345
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,000
We were completely unprepared!

346
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:08,960
We can't hold them!

347
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:09,520
How is that possible?

348
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:11,720
Hold them as long as you can!

349
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:53,240
Good.

350
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,160
Well done.

351
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:57,760
Battalion Commander, sir.

352
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,320
Our forces have retaken the position.

353
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,040
Red Force suffered heavy casualties.

354
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,200
They are in no position to fight back.

355
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,800
Locked onto the Red Force command vehicle?

356
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,560
Our scouts are locking onto the target.

357
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:06,360
Once the coordinates are confirmed,

358
00:18:06,360 --> 00:18:07,680
we can end this battle immediately.

359
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,280
Good.

360
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:10,600
Send the coordinates to Company One immediately.

361
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,120
Yes, sir.

362
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,520
Prepare to initiate electronic jamming.

363
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:12,960
Yes, sir.

364
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,760
How are the Infantry Academy cadets doing?

365
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:15,640
They're actually pretty good.

366
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,880
They fight with solid tactics.

367
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,560
Oh really?

368
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:19,800
What are the radar search results?

369
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,680
Still searching.

370
00:18:21,760 --> 00:18:22,560
After all,

371
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,560
they're about to become officers.

372
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,880
We can't underestimate them.

373
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:26,760
However,

374
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:27,760
they won't last much longer.

375
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,920
Section Chief Liu did them no favors.

376
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,920
He gave them zero heavy equipment.

377
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,440
It's all light infantry operations.

378
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:34,320
Right now,

379
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:36,080
they're pinned down by us at Hill 174.

380
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:36,960
Two rounds of heavy artillery

381
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,680
should finish them off.

382
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,640
Lock onto their position.

383
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:41,560
I'll personally collect Guo Zijian's body.

384
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,120
Why so angry?

385
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,600
Do you have a grudge against him?

386
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,520
Gather around.

387
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:54,160
We only have 15 men left right now.

388
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,360
We have no heavy firepower.

389
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:57,640
So we must resort to special ops tactics.

390
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,320
Execute a decapitation strike.

391
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:58,960
Captain.

392
00:18:59,160 --> 00:18:59,760
Give the word.

393
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:00,400
What's the plan?

394
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:03,240
This location here

395
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,280
is the Blue Force commander's tent.

396
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:06,240
Groups One and Two,

397
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,680
you will clear the perimeter guards.

398
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:08,400
Group Three,

399
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:09,360
you handle the explosives.

400
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:11,680
Destroy their vehicles and comms gear,

401
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,880
and draw enemy fire.

402
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,240
Groups Four and Five,

403
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:16,280
follow me into direct combat.

404
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:18,000
We must force the Blue Force commander

405
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:19,120
out of his nest.

406
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:19,520
Yes, sir!

407
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:20,120
Liu Dong!

408
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:20,640
Here!

409
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:22,320
Quickly take the high ground

410
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,200
and wait for the chance to strike.

411
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,120
No problem.

412
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:25,320
But what if they just hide inside

413
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:25,720
and never come out?

414
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:27,160
They won't.

415
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,920
With me here, he'll definitely show up.

416
00:19:30,800 --> 00:19:31,680
Did you bring the gear?

417
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,760
Don't worry, we have it all.

418
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:33,360
Good.

419
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:34,840
Time is tight.

420
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:35,960
Move out!

421
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:06,840
Move out.

422
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:32,800
Battalion Commander.

423
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,280
They're cadets from the Infantry Academy.

424
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:36,640
We were just wondering how to find them,

425
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,160
and they delivered themselves right to our doorstep.

426
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:40,000
Search for Guo Zijian's location.

427
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:40,600
Yes, sir.

428
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,160
Battalion Commander.

429
00:21:47,080 --> 00:21:48,000
Guo Zijian,

430
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:50,240
you brought a few cadets

431
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:52,360
to eliminate me, Jiang Shengqiang, right?

432
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:54,160
You really overestimate yourself.

433
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:56,240
I'll give you a chance.

434
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:59,280
Come out and surrender peacefully.

435
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:02,160
I, Jiang Shengqiang, give you my word

436
00:22:03,320 --> 00:22:05,320
that you'll survive the exercise.

437
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:06,480
What do you say?

438
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,560
Sniper neutralized.

439
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,520
Guo Zijian.

440
00:22:25,840 --> 00:22:27,840
Your sniper has been taken out.

441
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:29,560
You have no cards left to play.

442
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:31,920
Come out!

443
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,160
Who says I'm out of trump cards?

444
00:22:58,720 --> 00:22:59,520
Battalion Commander Jiang.

445
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,240
You lost.

446
00:23:04,560 --> 00:23:06,200
Still relying on these cheap tricks.

447
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:09,200
Chen Xin.

448
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:09,760
Here!

449
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:14,800
One-on-one.

450
00:23:16,760 --> 00:23:18,120
Time to settle our old score.

451
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:20,240
Alright.

452
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:24,400
Then I'll play along.

453
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:44,320
You're all KIA.

454
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,200
Cease fire!

455
00:24:49,840 --> 00:24:51,280
Who told you to fire?

456
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:59,240
Jiang Shengqiang!

457
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:01,480
Have you lost your mind?

458
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:03,560
The Exercise Control

459
00:25:03,560 --> 00:25:05,280
has a dedicated communication channel.

460
00:25:05,280 --> 00:25:06,880
You've known this since day one, right?

461
00:25:07,520 --> 00:25:08,480
So how is it possible

462
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,880
that someone just walks up to you

463
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,080
and gives you orders directly?

464
00:25:13,840 --> 00:25:14,880
Speak!

465
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,560
Orders from Deputy Army Commander Liang.

466
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,280
They also said Deputy Army Commander Liang

467
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:23,160
was very unhappy with our exercise setup.

468
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:25,960
He thought we were just putting on a show,

469
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,240
not fighting a real battle.

470
00:25:28,800 --> 00:25:29,480
So,

471
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:31,800
he ordered me to shut down all comms,

472
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,080
eliminate all interference,

473
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:34,640
and hit them hard.

474
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:37,440
You got fooled by two cadets?

475
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:40,240
You're the model soldier of 396th Brigade!

476
00:25:40,840 --> 00:25:41,720
Old Jiang,

477
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:42,800
aren't you just letting

478
00:25:42,800 --> 00:25:44,840
the Infantry Academy laugh at us?

479
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:49,080
They drove an Exercise Control vehicle

480
00:25:49,360 --> 00:25:51,240
and wearing their insignia.

481
00:25:51,760 --> 00:25:53,280
Deputy Army Commander Liang just arrived.

482
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:54,240
The exercise was suspended.

483
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,520
I had no choice but to believe them.

484
00:25:55,800 --> 00:25:57,840
How could I know they faked the orders?

485
00:25:57,840 --> 00:25:58,560
All right, stop arguing.

486
00:25:58,560 --> 00:25:59,880
You think you're in the right, huh?

487
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:00,800
Enough.

488
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:08,520
Why are you standing there?

489
00:26:09,280 --> 00:26:10,160
Comparing heights?

490
00:26:15,360 --> 00:26:16,280
So you're saying,

491
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:19,280
this was really the Infantry Academy's

492
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:21,400
Staff Officer Guo Zijian?

493
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:22,480
Yes.

494
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:23,600
It was him.

495
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:25,800
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

496
00:26:26,120 --> 00:26:26,840
we can't just

497
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:28,360
let this slide, can we?

498
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:31,640
We followed the commanders' requirements,

499
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:32,760
spending so much time and effort

500
00:26:32,760 --> 00:26:34,840
to organize this joint exercise.

501
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:37,400
Just to let the Infantry Academy cadets

502
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:39,440
experience actual combat?

503
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:42,080
We did a ton of prep work for this,

504
00:26:42,800 --> 00:26:44,600
and referenced so many training videos.

505
00:26:45,080 --> 00:26:47,120
Such a perfect plan

506
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:48,920
was ruined just because of Guo Zijian.

507
00:26:49,040 --> 00:26:50,600
He turned it into a complete mess.

508
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:53,920
Basically,

509
00:26:54,600 --> 00:26:56,160
he played us for fools.

510
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:02,440
What was Guo Zijian's

511
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,960
motive

512
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:06,760
for doing this?

513
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:09,120
Why else would he do it?

514
00:27:09,840 --> 00:27:11,040
Just to show off.

515
00:27:11,360 --> 00:27:12,320
Look, Commissar.

516
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:14,120
First, he had the 2nd Battalion

517
00:27:14,120 --> 00:27:15,440
catch the 1st Battalion off guard

518
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:17,080
and beat them to a pulp.

519
00:27:17,320 --> 00:27:18,800
Then he took his cadets

520
00:27:18,800 --> 00:27:20,640
and decapitated Jiang Shengqiang.

521
00:27:21,080 --> 00:27:21,920
It seems

522
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:24,840
everyone in our 396th Brigade is an idiot,

523
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:26,640
and he's the only hero.

524
00:27:30,040 --> 00:27:31,480
Slapping people in the face publicly,

525
00:27:31,840 --> 00:27:34,160
then stepping on them to climb up.

526
00:27:36,320 --> 00:27:36,960
Exactly.

527
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:39,760
That's exactly Guo Zijian's personality.

528
00:27:40,080 --> 00:27:41,680
You knew him before?

529
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:49,320
Then there's no doubt about it.

530
00:27:49,480 --> 00:27:51,840
He's counting on us not punishing him,

531
00:27:51,840 --> 00:27:53,480
so he's pushing his luck.

532
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:54,960
On the surface,

533
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:56,160
it's for the cadets.

534
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:58,760
But really, it's to show himself off.

535
00:27:58,760 --> 00:28:01,520
So he can claim credit from the academy.

536
00:28:04,280 --> 00:28:05,280
Commanders,

537
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:07,760
I don't know what you think about this,

538
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:09,240
but I personally feel

539
00:28:09,520 --> 00:28:11,080
if that's really the case,

540
00:28:11,120 --> 00:28:12,520
then this guy's character

541
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,120
is absolutely questionable.

542
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:21,480
Had your fun?

543
00:28:22,840 --> 00:28:23,720
Sir.

544
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,360
One thing led to another.

545
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,520
It just happened that way.

546
00:28:26,960 --> 00:28:28,160
What kind of thing

547
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:30,400
leads you to kidnap an evaluator?

548
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,080
I was out of options.

549
00:28:33,360 --> 00:28:34,040
Besides,

550
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:36,160
you personally took charge this time,

551
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:37,840
leading the team for training.

552
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:39,640
If the exercise ended just like that,

553
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:41,640
we couldn't justify it to anyone.

554
00:28:41,800 --> 00:28:43,560
Don't try to hide behind my name.

555
00:28:44,600 --> 00:28:45,760
If we were at the academy,

556
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:47,440
we could sweep some things under the rug.

557
00:28:47,560 --> 00:28:48,560
I think we could get away with it.

558
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,000
But on an occasion like today,

559
00:28:50,080 --> 00:28:51,280
and on their turf,

560
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,480
how do I clean up your mess?

561
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,200
I'll take the blame for whatever happens.

562
00:28:55,280 --> 00:28:56,480
Easy for you to say.

563
00:28:56,560 --> 00:28:57,520
You'll take the blame?

564
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:58,920
You're just a battalion staff officer.

565
00:28:59,040 --> 00:29:00,160
Even if we chopped you to pieces,

566
00:29:00,280 --> 00:29:01,440
you wouldn't amount to much.

567
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:02,920
How can you possibly take responsibility?

568
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:03,600
Sir,

569
00:29:03,600 --> 00:29:04,760
I didn't mean anything else.

570
00:29:05,760 --> 00:29:06,680
However they punish me,

571
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:07,520
I won't complain.

572
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:09,000
As long as you aren't implicated.

573
00:29:09,320 --> 00:29:10,160
Nonsense!

574
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:12,520
Am I, Chen Guangjian, that kind of person?

575
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,080
Besides,

576
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:18,360
even if they executed you right now,

577
00:29:18,560 --> 00:29:19,640
do you think I'd be off the hook?

578
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:21,680
Sir,

579
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,960
didn't we complete the mission?

580
00:29:24,960 --> 00:29:26,080
Successful, my ass!

581
00:29:26,320 --> 00:29:27,800
You turned the 396th Brigade

582
00:29:27,840 --> 00:29:28,880
upside down,

583
00:29:28,960 --> 00:29:30,040
and made a complete mess of them.

584
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:31,760
If they didn't water down the exercise,

585
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:33,040
would I have gone that far?

586
00:29:33,160 --> 00:29:34,160
You've got guts.

587
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:35,760
But

588
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:36,880
let me tell you,

589
00:29:37,560 --> 00:29:39,200
to wrap this up smoothly,

590
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:41,360
on the 396th Brigade's turf,

591
00:29:41,600 --> 00:29:43,400
you'd better keep your head down.

592
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,480
Take whatever criticism they give,

593
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,200
and swallow it all without a word.

594
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:49,120
Just a meeting to criticize me, right?

595
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:49,800
I accept it.

596
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,600
You don't look like you're backing down.

597
00:29:51,600 --> 00:29:52,320
Of course.

598
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:53,880
I single-handedly turned the tide

599
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,640
and promoted realistic combat training.

600
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:57,200
You should know very well,

601
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:59,040
about kidnapping Staff Officer Liang,

602
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,760
if they made a huge deal out of it,

603
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:02,240
they could dismiss you on the spot.

604
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,520
What era is this?

605
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:04,800
Who still blows things out of proportion?

606
00:30:04,800 --> 00:30:07,040
Discipline applies in any era.

607
00:30:10,040 --> 00:30:11,120
Since we have some time now,

608
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:13,040
prepare yourself well.

609
00:30:14,320 --> 00:30:15,160
To tell you the truth,

610
00:30:15,200 --> 00:30:16,840
in this afternoon's debriefing,

611
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:19,080
what they want and need to hear

612
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:20,400
is your self-criticism.

613
00:30:20,680 --> 00:30:21,600
A real self-criticism?

614
00:30:21,760 --> 00:30:22,560
Obviously.

615
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:24,000
I'm warning you,

616
00:30:24,280 --> 00:30:25,680
regardless of your original intentions,

617
00:30:25,760 --> 00:30:27,080
you must focus on the facts.

618
00:30:27,280 --> 00:30:28,360
Your self-criticism must be profound.

619
00:30:29,040 --> 00:30:30,480
What counts as profound?

620
00:30:30,600 --> 00:30:32,000
Stop being glib with me.

621
00:30:33,720 --> 00:30:35,360
You must be serious on this occasion.

622
00:30:35,520 --> 00:30:37,400
Not only will unit core members attend,

623
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:39,040
but even Deputy Army Commander Liang

624
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:40,080
will attend in person.

625
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:41,760
You'd better weigh the consequences.

626
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,120
All right.

627
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:46,480
I'll go prepare profoundly.

628
00:30:47,040 --> 00:30:47,520
Go on.

629
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,200
Yes, sir.

630
00:30:53,360 --> 00:30:55,280
This meeting today was truly...

631
00:30:56,760 --> 00:30:57,560
Guo Zijian.

632
00:31:06,760 --> 00:31:07,760
Same as always.

633
00:31:08,840 --> 00:31:10,360
Always relying on underhanded tricks

634
00:31:10,360 --> 00:31:11,200
to achieve your goals.

635
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:12,760
You haven't changed a bit.

636
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:15,080
We haven't seen each other in years,

637
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,840
and you're still such a sore loser.

638
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:19,080
Don't you want to fight for real?

639
00:31:21,120 --> 00:31:21,840
Fight for real?

640
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:26,760
Guo Zijian.

641
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,200
I actually really hope

642
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:32,040
to have a real showdown with you.

643
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:34,240
When that time comes,

644
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,640
you will definitely lose to me.

645
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:38,280
And by then,

646
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:40,560
I hope you'll have what it takes.

647
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:47,680
I mean, if at the start,

648
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:50,000
we fought the 2nd Battalion fairly,

649
00:31:50,400 --> 00:31:52,240
we might not have lost so badly.

650
00:31:54,560 --> 00:31:56,600
They said to play by the rules at first,

651
00:31:57,080 --> 00:31:58,520
then stabbed us in the back.

652
00:31:58,840 --> 00:32:00,040
Who does that?

653
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:02,480
I've been a soldier for so many years,

654
00:32:03,600 --> 00:32:05,280
and I've never been so humiliated.

655
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,000
Wu Dongsheng,

656
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:08,920
why are you complaining too?

657
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:12,240
I actually think this is a good thing.

658
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,400
Only this way

659
00:32:14,560 --> 00:32:16,160
can you truly understand

660
00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:18,920
that the battlefield is ever-changing.

661
00:32:19,320 --> 00:32:21,320
Anything can happen.

662
00:32:22,440 --> 00:32:23,760
If you had

663
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:26,320
concealed yourselves per tactical rules,

664
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:28,320
how could you suffer such a heavy loss?

665
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,000
Come on, Instructor,

666
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,520
we got played so badly by them.

667
00:32:30,520 --> 00:32:31,960
How can you still be so calm?

668
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:32,840
Then let me ask you,

669
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:35,040
didn't our Red Army win in the end?

670
00:32:35,120 --> 00:32:36,120
What's bad about that?

671
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:37,680
But the victory was secured

672
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,440
by the Infantry Academy.

673
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:39,560
What's good about that?

674
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:40,320
Exactly.

675
00:32:40,360 --> 00:32:41,720
Well, the cadets from the Infantry Academy

676
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:43,520
are also part of our Red Army, right?

677
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:44,120
True,

678
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:45,480
their decapitation strike succeeded.

679
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:46,680
But that's also because

680
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:48,400
we pinned down the Blue Army's firepower

681
00:32:48,480 --> 00:32:50,000
and affected Jiang Shengqiang's judgment.

682
00:32:50,120 --> 00:32:50,720
Therefore,

683
00:32:51,080 --> 00:32:51,760
the credit

684
00:32:52,080 --> 00:32:52,800
and the honor

685
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:54,840
belong to all of us together.

686
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,400
That kind of honor,

687
00:32:56,760 --> 00:32:57,680
I'd rather not have.

688
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:03,840
Wu Dongsheng.

689
00:33:04,080 --> 00:33:04,640
Here!

690
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:08,840
Is this the kind of attitude

691
00:33:08,840 --> 00:33:09,960
a veteran like you should have?

692
00:33:11,800 --> 00:33:14,120
Is this the example you set for everyone?

693
00:33:14,240 --> 00:33:15,000
Instructor.

694
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:17,800
I've been a soldier for so many years.

695
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:20,120
How many more battles can I fight?

696
00:33:21,120 --> 00:33:21,760
Can't you

697
00:33:22,360 --> 00:33:23,880
just let me on the battlefield

698
00:33:24,040 --> 00:33:25,800
to fight to my heart's content this once?

699
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:27,800
Wu Dongsheng, don't get so worked up.

700
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:28,640
I've got the scoop!

701
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:29,360
Sit down, sit down.

702
00:33:29,360 --> 00:33:30,000
I've got the scoop!

703
00:33:31,000 --> 00:33:31,640
Instructor.

704
00:33:32,120 --> 00:33:34,040
I know the inside story of today.

705
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:35,160
What is it? Spit it out.

706
00:33:35,360 --> 00:33:35,960
It was

707
00:33:36,320 --> 00:33:37,680
the cadet detachment captain,

708
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,200
Guo Zijian, who pulled this stunt.

709
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:40,360
What?

710
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:42,240
What's he after?

711
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:44,320
We were already predetermined to win.

712
00:33:44,360 --> 00:33:45,560
Isn't this just completely redundant

713
00:33:45,760 --> 00:33:46,680
and totally unnecessary?

714
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:47,240
Company Commander.

715
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:48,320
But think about it.

716
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:50,240
Under the original plan, we'd win,

717
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:51,200
but that honor

718
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:52,920
would go to 1st Battalion, 396th Brigade,

719
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:53,960
not to Guo Zijian.

720
00:33:54,480 --> 00:33:55,360
But look at him now.

721
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:57,640
Not only did he play Chief Liu

722
00:33:58,240 --> 00:33:59,680
and trick our 1st Battalion,

723
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:01,680
Even Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

724
00:34:01,800 --> 00:34:03,120
all became pawns for Guo Zijian

725
00:34:03,120 --> 00:34:04,480
to make a name for himself.

726
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:06,640
Isn't that clever?

727
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:07,440
Very clever.

728
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:08,440
Clever my foot!

729
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:11,159
He's stepping on our shoulders to climb!

730
00:34:14,360 --> 00:34:16,159
First time on the front lines,

731
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:18,080
first time participating in a drill,

732
00:34:18,440 --> 00:34:20,480
and you actually got captured by them.

733
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:23,080
Sir.

734
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:25,080
This is also the first time I've heard

735
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:27,320
that Exercise Control can be used so.

736
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:30,320
Can an exercise just have no rules at all?

737
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:31,760
How could it?

738
00:34:32,639 --> 00:34:34,320
For breaking rules and discipline,

739
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:35,440
the military will definitely punish him.

740
00:34:35,719 --> 00:34:36,920
But you,

741
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:38,840
with your pure heart,

742
00:34:39,280 --> 00:34:40,880
have stayed in the ivory tower too long.

743
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,159
Being taught a lesson like this

744
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:44,440
isn't a bad thing for you.

745
00:34:45,120 --> 00:34:46,920
A lesson like this is terrible.

746
00:34:48,360 --> 00:34:49,280
It's just like

747
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:51,199
hitting the referee in a football match.

748
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,719
It's of pretty much the same nature.

749
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,199
Then think about it.

750
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:55,679
If on a football pitch,

751
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,640
there are blatant fouls

752
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:58,880
and the referee turns a blind eye,

753
00:34:59,040 --> 00:35:00,160
then for players who want to play

754
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:02,160
a high-quality match,

755
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:03,560
grabbing the referee

756
00:35:03,560 --> 00:35:04,360
to vent their anger,

757
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,240
what's wrong with that?

758
00:35:05,640 --> 00:35:06,480
Professor.

759
00:35:06,680 --> 00:35:08,760
You taught me to call a spade a spade.

760
00:35:09,520 --> 00:35:11,560
And the 396th Brigade's exercise plan

761
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:12,480
was made by themselves.

762
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:14,080
We are merely assisting Exercise Control.

763
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:16,720
For you to protect him like this,

764
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:18,280
doesn't make sense, does it?

765
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:19,720
Of course.

766
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:20,840
It's called

767
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:22,400
understandable,

768
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:23,320
but

769
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:24,280
unforgivable.

770
00:35:24,640 --> 00:35:25,480
With me saying this,

771
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:26,760
are you satisfied now?

772
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:28,840
Basically satisfied,

773
00:35:30,600 --> 00:35:32,000
but I'm still a bit mad.

774
00:35:33,120 --> 00:35:34,200
Don't worry.

775
00:35:34,600 --> 00:35:35,560
I will definitely help you

776
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:37,600
vent this anger.

777
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,280
I won't recite the Army's directives,

778
00:35:57,960 --> 00:35:59,320
to save some people from blushing.

779
00:36:02,040 --> 00:36:02,720
Staff Officer Guo,

780
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,080
let's stick to the facts.

781
00:36:04,640 --> 00:36:06,640
No need to use the Army's directives

782
00:36:06,640 --> 00:36:07,640
as a weapon to intimidate others.

783
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:08,360
Fine.

784
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:12,400
Even if the Army's directives are heavy,

785
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:14,480
then let me ask,

786
00:36:15,160 --> 00:36:17,400
why can't we bring them out

787
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:19,400
to pressure those who refuse to progress?

788
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,400
Why can't we bring them out

789
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:25,000
to clearly demonstrate

790
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:26,640
the direction we should be striving toward?

791
00:36:27,120 --> 00:36:27,880
Guo Zijian!

792
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:28,520
Here!

793
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:30,200
A self-criticism is a self-criticism.

794
00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:31,440
Watch your tone.

795
00:36:32,080 --> 00:36:32,600
Yes, sir!

796
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,760
I admit

797
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:39,600
that in this exercise,

798
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:42,960
my actions were indeed out of line.

799
00:36:44,600 --> 00:36:45,960
I seriously reflect on my mistakes

800
00:36:47,240 --> 00:36:49,520
and will accept any punishment.

801
00:36:50,720 --> 00:36:52,560
My self-criticism is sincere.

802
00:36:53,720 --> 00:36:55,240
But at the same time,

803
00:36:55,240 --> 00:36:57,320
I want to share my true thoughts here.

804
00:36:57,840 --> 00:36:58,880
Our academy chose

805
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:00,800
to join the 396th Brigade's 1st Battalion

806
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:01,880
to play the Red Force,

807
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:04,360
to give our graduating cadets

808
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:06,000
a lesson in actual combat exercises.

809
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:08,480
This was a very careful decision.

810
00:37:09,560 --> 00:37:11,080
The reason is we understand

811
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:13,760
this unit, during the revolutionary war,

812
00:37:13,760 --> 00:37:15,080
was an invincible force,

813
00:37:15,760 --> 00:37:18,000
and in the new historical period,

814
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:18,960
has constantly forged ahead

815
00:37:18,960 --> 00:37:20,400
and taken on a new look.

816
00:37:21,440 --> 00:37:22,360
It is also a unit

817
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:24,040
that was among the first to start

818
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:26,400
building combined arms battalions.

819
00:37:27,120 --> 00:37:28,600
Building combined arms battalions

820
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:31,640
is a major measure in this Army transition,

821
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:33,720
which will surely allow the system's

822
00:37:33,720 --> 00:37:34,960
unique advantages

823
00:37:36,240 --> 00:37:38,040
to be more fully demonstrated,

824
00:37:38,640 --> 00:37:40,000
promoting our Army's development

825
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:41,600
toward being robust,

826
00:37:41,680 --> 00:37:42,200
combined,

827
00:37:42,640 --> 00:37:43,280
versatile,

828
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,360
and flexible.

829
00:37:45,240 --> 00:37:46,240
I firmly support this.

830
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:49,480
As a reformed Army,

831
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:51,400
in the years to come,

832
00:37:51,680 --> 00:37:53,720
we will likely still capture hilltops.

833
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:55,760
But even if we capture hilltops,

834
00:37:56,280 --> 00:37:58,640
they should be 21st-century hilltops,

835
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:02,160
with info-based offense and defense,

836
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:03,480
hilltops with the distinct characteristics

837
00:38:03,760 --> 00:38:05,240
of the modern battlefield.

838
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:06,880
Moreover,

839
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,360
no matter how this hilltop is captured,

840
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:11,440
it should be a life-and-death struggle,

841
00:38:12,240 --> 00:38:14,120
a closely fought contest,

842
00:38:14,560 --> 00:38:16,240
and an evenly matched confrontation.

843
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:21,000
But what was shown to us today?

844
00:38:23,080 --> 00:38:23,760
Guo Zijian!

845
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:25,120
Get down here right now!

846
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:26,920
No, no, no, Dean Chen.

847
00:38:27,160 --> 00:38:28,240
Let him finish.

848
00:38:28,680 --> 00:38:29,400
Staff Officer Guo,

849
00:38:29,920 --> 00:38:30,440
Here!

850
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:32,040
continue speaking.

851
00:38:32,200 --> 00:38:33,160
Speak your mind fully.

852
00:38:33,840 --> 00:38:34,760
Thank you, Commander!

853
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:38,640
I don't have much else to say.

854
00:38:39,120 --> 00:38:40,720
I just want to tell everyone,

855
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:42,200
our cadets

856
00:38:42,680 --> 00:38:44,560
have spent years in the military academy

857
00:38:44,560 --> 00:38:46,600
being immersed in advanced theories.

858
00:38:47,200 --> 00:38:48,760
Do you really have the heart

859
00:38:49,160 --> 00:38:50,120
to let these young,

860
00:38:50,120 --> 00:38:51,880
blank-slate future officers

861
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:54,000
take the experience from today's exercise

862
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:55,400
into future battlefields

863
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,920
to fight the enemy,

864
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:57,880
